      "value": "Both ISO and shutter speed are physical concepts not applicable to virtual cameras. A simple \"exposure\" slider can be done though, and even would make sense given that most worlds use HDR rendering.\nAnother aspect of shutter speed is motion blur, which can be an option too I guess?",
      "viewerReactions": null
